give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Experience The Experimental\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Steward", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 good player."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Noble", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 3 players, 1 and only 1 of which is evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shugenja", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing if your closest evil player is clockwise or anti-clockwise. If equidistant, this info is arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bounty Hunter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 evil player. If the player you know dies, you learn another evil player tonight. [1 Townsfolk is evil]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "High Priestess", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, learn which player the Storyteller believes you should talk to most."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Preacher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: a Minion, if chosen, learns this. All chosen Minions have no ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cult Leader", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you become the alignment of an alive neighbor. If all good players choose to join your cult, your team wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Acrobat", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: if they are or become drunk or poisoned tonight, you die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Huntsman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a living player: the Damsel, if chosen, becomes a not-in-play Townsfolk. [+the Damsel]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alchemist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have a Minion ability. When using this, the Storyteller may prompt you to choose differently."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cannibal", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have the ability of the recently killed executee. If they are evil, you are poisoned until a good player dies by execution."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each day, privately guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Banshee", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf the Demon kills you, all players learn this. From now on, you may nominate twice per day and vote twice per nomination."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Magician", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Demon thinks you are a Minion. Minions think you are a Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hatter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Minion & Demon players may choose new Minion & Demon characters to be."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zealot", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive, you must vote for every nomination."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Puzzlemaster", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n1 player is drunk, even if you die. If you guess (once) who it is, learn the Demon player, but guess wrong & get false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wizard", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nOnce per game, choose to make a wish. If granted, it might have a price & leave a clue as to its nature."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wraith", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou may choose to open your eyes at night. You wake when other evil players do."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Boomdandy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf you are executed, all but 3 players die. After a 10 to 1 countdown, the player with the most players pointing at them, dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Organ Grinder", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nAll players keep their eyes closed when voting and the vote tally is secret. Each night, choose if you are drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Boffin", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThe Demon (even if drunk or poisoned) has a not-in-play good character\u2019s ability. You both know which."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Ojo", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a character: they die. If they are not in play, the Storyteller chooses who dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Kazali", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. [You choose which players are which Minions. -? to +? Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Riot", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nOn day 3, Minions become Riot & nominees die but nominate an alive player immediately. This must happen."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Leviathan", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf more than 1 good player is executed, evil wins. All players know you are in play. After day 5, evil wins."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Experience The Experimental Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Experience The Experimental\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]